{"3563080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Swords & Slippers", "steam_appid": 3563080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/8fcdfdfd0d6945267617bd4fb17414b2.poster.avif?t=1786625281\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/8fcdfdfd0d6945267617bd4fb17414b2.webm?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/8fcdfdfd0d6945267617bd4fb17414b2.mp4?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stepmothers took the thrones. Princesses took up arms. Swords &amp; Slippers is old-school character action with a roguelite kick. Fight as a squad of the fairytale heroines you know: reimagined, weaponized, and yours to lead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK GOOD DOING IT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks branch into deep combo routes, every hit landing with a satisfying crunch. Defense keeps you dangerous, while the style meter rewards creativity. Swap between your heroines mid-combo, never drop the chain, and look gorgeous while the body count climbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/92b2f5235aa07a74d0890fed68ed1ee8.poster.avif?t=1786625281\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/92b2f5235aa07a74d0890fed68ed1ee8.webm?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/92b2f5235aa07a74d0890fed68ed1ee8.mp4?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY PRINCESS IS A WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow White crushes foes with a dwarven pickaxe. Red Hood is the wolf of her own story. Rapunzel's hair has a mind - and a mouth - of its own. No two heroines fight alike, and the roster grows alongside the rebellion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEPMOTHERS DON'T FIGHT FAIR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armored knights and twisted creatures are only the beginning. Survive long enough, and you'll come face to face with the storybook legends of your childhood, reimagined as bosses built to break you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWER UP BEFORE MIDNIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run begins at dawn. Arm your heroines with elemental powers and unleash them through skillful combat. Earn new powers and grow stronger as the hours pass. You'll need everything you've got by midnight, when enemies are deadliest and rewards richest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/b10e3b719968a16448ab116cfacd0643.poster.avif?t=1786625281\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/b10e3b719968a16448ab116cfacd0643.webm?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/b10e3b719968a16448ab116cfacd0643.mp4?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARMING HAS WORK TO DO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, the heroines come home to the castle - and to you, Prince Charming. Win their trust, uncover their secrets, and let your choices shape each heroine's story. Romance them if you like - but mind your cursed charm, or affection curdles into dangerous obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/220b1e1de2f88bfa98fcbea546e74915.poster.avif?t=1786625281\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/220b1e1de2f88bfa98fcbea546e74915.webm?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/220b1e1de2f88bfa98fcbea546e74915.mp4?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RETELL THE FAIRYTALES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story reacts to how you play. The heroines you bring, the paths you take, and how far you push can unlock scenes that may never surface on another run. Uncover what really happened, and rewrite the fairytales you thought you knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fairytales get retold. Princesses get even. Stepmothers get a war.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/c82267b8cc8da78b5cd2f0d0baf08eec.poster.avif?t=1786625281\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/c82267b8cc8da78b5cd2f0d0baf08eec.webm?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/c82267b8cc8da78b5cd2f0d0baf08eec.mp4?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/8fcdfdfd0d6945267617bd4fb17414b2.poster.avif?t=1786625281\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/8fcdfdfd0d6945267617bd4fb17414b2.webm?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/8fcdfdfd0d6945267617bd4fb17414b2.mp4?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stepmothers took the thrones. Princesses took up arms. Swords &amp; Slippers is old-school character action with a roguelite kick. Fight as a squad of the fairytale heroines you know: reimagined, weaponized, and yours to lead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK GOOD DOING IT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your attacks branch into deep combo routes, every hit landing with a satisfying crunch. Defense keeps you dangerous, while the style meter rewards creativity. Swap between your heroines mid-combo, never drop the chain, and look gorgeous while the body count climbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/92b2f5235aa07a74d0890fed68ed1ee8.poster.avif?t=1786625281\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/92b2f5235aa07a74d0890fed68ed1ee8.webm?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/92b2f5235aa07a74d0890fed68ed1ee8.mp4?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY PRINCESS IS A WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow White crushes foes with a dwarven pickaxe. Red Hood is the wolf of her own story. Rapunzel's hair has a mind - and a mouth - of its own. No two heroines fight alike, and the roster grows alongside the rebellion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STEPMOTHERS DON'T FIGHT FAIR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armored knights and twisted creatures are only the beginning. Survive long enough, and you'll come face to face with the storybook legends of your childhood, reimagined as bosses built to break you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POWER UP BEFORE MIDNIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run begins at dawn. Arm your heroines with elemental powers and unleash them through skillful combat. Earn new powers and grow stronger as the hours pass. You'll need everything you've got by midnight, when enemies are deadliest and rewards richest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/b10e3b719968a16448ab116cfacd0643.poster.avif?t=1786625281\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/b10e3b719968a16448ab116cfacd0643.webm?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/b10e3b719968a16448ab116cfacd0643.mp4?t=1786625281\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARMING HAS WORK TO DO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, the heroines come home to the castle - and to you, Prince Charming. Win their trust, uncover their secrets, and let your choices shape each heroine's story. Romance them if you like - but mind your cursed charm, or affection curdles into dangerous obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/220b1e1de2f88bfa98fcbea546e74915.poster.avif?t=1786625281\" width=1170 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563080/extras/220b1e1de2f88bfa98f